    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just \"feelings\" tho. i see it in their faces. the way my husband looks at the medical bills, or how my daughter has to help me walk. it's like i've taken away their ability to just live their own lives because they're so busy taking care of mine. i just want them to have their freedom back.",
