      "content": "i know there are resources but they don't change the reality. the bills keep coming and i keep getting worse. i just keep thinking... if i weren't here, they could finally breathe. they could travel, or spend money on things that actually matter, instead of just managing my decline. wouldn't it be more selfless to just stop being the problem?",
